# pstack mode

mode: cursor

This session is Cursor, including when it is a Cursor cloud agent. Cloud workers are Cursor cloud agents at https://cursor.com/agents. Spawn them with the Task tool and `environment: "cloud"`. `$swarm-cloud` means that path.

Do not look for `codex`. Do not run `codex cloud exec`. Do not use the Codex model table. Codex mode applies only when the session itself is Codex.

Read `skills/pstack-set-mode/references/modes.md` before choosing a backend.
